            <description sparkle:format="markdown">Fixes license activation and trial recovery.

- Paid licenses now remain active after successful verification.
- Seven-day trials can recover safely if setup was interrupted before the activation was saved.
- Secure-storage failures now roll back cleanly instead of discarding a valid activation.
</description>
